#[cap(a: uniq @ k * 4 + 4 + j..k * 4 + 8, a: shrd @ {k * 4 + j..k * 4 + 4})]
fn inner_j(k: usize, j: usize, a: &mut [i32; 16]) {
    let row_len = 4;
    let step = 1;
    let more = j < row_len;
    if more {
        let j_next = j + step;
        let krow = k * row_len;
        let dstrow = krow + row_len;
        let src_k = krow + j;
        let dst = dstrow + j;
        let vk = a[src_k];
        a[dst] = vk;
        inner_j(k, j_next, a)
    } else {
        let unit = ();
        unit
    }
}

#[cap(a: uniq @0..16)]
fn outer_k(k: usize, a: &mut [i32; 16]) {
    let zero = 0;
    let one = 1;
    let k_end = 3;
    let more = k < k_end;
    if more {
        let k_next = k + one;
        let inner_call = inner_j(k, zero, a);
        fence!();
        outer_k(k_next, a)
    } else {
        let unit = ();
        unit
    }
}

#[cap(a: uniq @ 4..16, a: uniq @ {0..4})]
fn pivot(a: &mut [i32; 16]) {
    let k0 = 0;
    let outer_call = outer_k(k0, a);
    let unit = ();
    unit
}
